  "name": "Slow Cooker Pork and Sauerkraut with Apples",
  "subtitle": "Tender pork with tart apples and savory sauerkraut",
  "description": "Pork chops cook slowly with apples, onion, sauerkraut, and fennel seed for a hearty six-serving meal.",
